      },
      "evidence_policy": "Open referenced input/output/geometry and numeric-table artifacts. Check file hashes, successful termination, real state/minimum/path evidence, recomputed units and arithmetic. JSON flags and synthetic fixtures are never scientific evidence."
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "rule_arm_geometry_control",
      "reference_id": "kp_arm_geometry_control",
      "type": "semantic",
      "expected": "Extract mapped arm from full geometry under a declared cap rule; compare frozen and relaxed arm and complete model. Preserve graph/partition/constraint files. Core rows: single_on_three_transoid, single_on_three_cisoid, three_fixed_arm. Recompute excitation_eV, oscillator_strength, interarm_transfer_fraction from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit. For single_on_three_transoid and single_on_three_cisoid, interarm_transfer_fraction is null with metric_applicability_reason: the capped single-arm object has no second arm. Excitation, oscillator strength and the mapped frozen-arm calculation remain mandatory. The three_fixed_arm row still requires a numeric interarm transfer fraction from the full three-arm transition density, with explicit fragment partitions and normalization; null is forbidden there.",
      "binding": {
        "artifact_paths": [
          "report/results.json",
          "report/report.md"
        ],
        "fields": [
          "$.results.arm_geometry_control",
          "$.calculation_records"
        ],
        "comparison": "Extract mapped arm from full geometry under a declared cap rule; compare frozen and relaxed arm and complete model. Preserve graph/partition/constraint files. Core rows: single_on_three_transoid, single_on_three_cisoid, three_fixed_arm. Recompute excitation_eV, oscillator_strength, interarm_transfer_fraction from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit. For single_on_three_transoid and single_on_three_cisoid, interarm_transfer_fraction is null with metric_applicability_reason: the capped single-arm object has no second arm. Excitation, oscillator strength and the mapped frozen-arm calculation remain mandatory. The three_fixed_arm row still requires a numeric interarm transfer fraction from the full three-arm transition density, with explicit fragment partitions and normalization; null is forbidden there."
      },
      "evidence_policy": "Open referenced input/output/geometry and numeric-table artifacts. Check file hashes, successful termination, real state/minimum/path evidence, recomputed units and arithmetic. JSON flags and synthetic fixtures are never scientific evidence."
